# CREDENTIALS — these four scripts hardcode an OpenNeuro API token.
# Excluded so it cannot enter git history, where removing it means rewriting every
# commit that ever touched it. This directory's sibling has been through that once
# already (phronesis-world, .git 9.9GB -> 52MB, 2026-07-29).
#
# The token is still live on disk and should be rotated: it was committed to no
# repo, but it sits in plain text in four files.
download_real_data.py
download_with_token.py
graphql_download.py
download_openneuro.py

# Large or regenerable
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
